---
---
<!-- Experience Timeline Section -->
<section class="reveal py-16 text-left" id="experience">
  <div class="mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-4">Pengalaman Kerja</h2>
    <div class="w-20 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full"></div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="relative ml-4 md:ml-8">
    <!-- Vertical Timeline Line -->
    <div class="absolute left-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1 timeline-line opacity-30"></div>
    
    <!-- Experience Item 1 -->
    <div class="relative pl-12 pb-16 group">
      <!-- Animated Pulse Bullet -->
      <div class="absolute left-[-4px] top-2 w-3 h-3 bg-primary rounded-full shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(173,198,255,1)] animate-pulse"></div>
      
      <span class="text-primary font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-tighter mb-2 block">
        August 2024 - Present
      </span>
      <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface">IT Support Specialist</h3>
      <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium mb-4">SD S Sekar Adi | Kabupaten Bogor</p>
      
      <div class="glass-card p-6 rounded-2xl max-w-2xl">
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-on-surface-variant">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
            <span>Menyelesaikan lebih dari 230+ masalah teknis pada perangkat keras komputer dan perangkat jaringan.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
            <span>Instalasi dan konfigurasi jaringan ethernet untuk 31 komputer di Laboratorium.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
            <span>Mengimplementasikan perangkat lunak pemantauan Veyon Master pada 31 komputer untuk meningkatkan manajemen lab komputer.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
